    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Some bunkers built walls. Some bunkers built <strong>you</strong>.”</em></p><p>Your chest houses a dense geomantic Heartstone, a knot of petrified Yesod and bad decisions. It reinforces your body, dampens hostile forces, and hums softly whenever the world is about to get weird.</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to Body.</li><li>You have resistance to kinetic damage.</li><li>You are unusually steady; you instinctively brace against shocks and impacts (represented as a small general bonus to checks).</li><li>Your body filters metaphysical fallout; your Radiation intake is reduced (handled by Bad Eden flags).</li></ul>",
